BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The (Unbelievably True) Story of Nicky O
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T153000
UID:261113kflge171Q0WeAc2Ma3OjQw
DESCRIPTION:*The (Unbelievably True) Story of Nicky O\,* a new rock musica
 l based on an incredible true story. Nicky O’Neill was an aspiring teena
 ge rockstar when\, in 2003\, he became the youngest victim in the deadly S
 tation Nightclub fire. Following his death\, a series of surprising supern
 atural events unfolded\, uniting his family & friends in the belief that N
 icky is forever watching over them from above.\n\nWith original music by N
 icky O’Neill and friends\, alongside a brand new book by local thespian 
 (and Nicky’s sister-in-law) Maureen O’Neill\, *Nicky O* is a moving\, 
 heartfelt\, and surprisingly funny message that our loved ones are never g
 one…they walk among us.
LOCATION:Rancho Cotate High School 
URL:https://omella.com/o04kd
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
