BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Back Care Yoga Workshop ~ Live with Greater Ease
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T150000
UID:261113M7n2526Rs0ClFRppzGQksQ
DESCRIPTION:**Back Care Yoga Workshop — Move with Greater Ease**\n\n*"Yo
 ur spine is your lifeline." — Denise Austin*\n\nGive your back the atten
 tion it deserves!\n\nAfter overcoming severe sciatica and finding lasting 
 relief\, experienced yoga instructor MaryEllen Whitton created this worksh
 op with a mission: to share the knowledge and techniques that made such a 
 profound difference in her own life.\n\n**This workshop goes beyond the yo
 ga mat!** Discover practical strategies\, simple movements\, and everyday 
 habits to improve spinal mobility\, release tension\, build strength\, and
  support a healthier back.\n\nLearn how small changes in the way you sit\,
  stand\, and move can make a meaningful difference in how you feel.\n\n**A
 ll levels welcome. No yoga experience necessary.**\n\nLeave with greater a
 wareness and practical tools to care for your spine every day.
LOCATION:Revolution Yoga- Lewis Studio 
URL:https://momence.com/Revolution-Yoga/Back-Care-for-Life/141898074?skipP
 review=true
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
