BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Reality Check Community Gathering
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
UID:261111Yb-87ZSIm0-Skc8ychUqRA
DESCRIPTION:AI Reality Check by Humans in Control\n\nDate and time: Saturd
 ay\, November 14 at 11:00 AM\n\nLocation: South Annex at The Key Room (Gil
 ardi Training & Events Center) · Novato · CA\n\nJoin your neighbors for 
 an AI Reality Check\, part of a nationwide campaign about what AI means fo
 r our jobs\, our kids\, and our future.\n\nIn a short\, plain-language pre
 sentation\, we'll look at what AI really is\, the risks it creates\, and c
 ommonsense steps we can take to keep humans in control. Expect real audien
 ce participation\, practical ways to take action\, and no jargon. You don'
 t need any AI expertise to join. Please register\, below!\n\nThis talk is 
 hosted by Sophie DeWitt\, a Marin County–based program manager with a ba
 ckground in education and advocacy. As a volunteer presenter\, she aims to
  bring these conversations into the community and to make the future of AI
  something we can all participate in shaping.\n\nLooking forward to seeing
  you there!\n\nRegistration: https://events.realitycheckhq.org/ai-reality-
 check-31471bbe?utm*source=library&utm*medium=listing\n\nHumans in Control 
 is a cross-partisan movement for commonsense AI rules.
LOCATION:The South Annex Room at the Gilardi Training and Events Center/Ke
 y Room
URL:https://events.realitycheckhq.org/ai-reality-check-31471bbe?utm_source
 =personal&utm_medium=listing
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
