DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re catching up on winning films you missed durin
 g the festival weekend or experiencing our lineup for the very first time\
 , join us for the ultimate “Best of the Fest–Audience Favorites” sho
 wcase! Selected directly by audience votes across all 8 screening blocks f
 rom our 5th annual festival\, this curated one-day retrospective brings to
 gether 12 to-rated short films from 7 countries.\n\nThis special program i
 ncludes two winning films unanimously selected by both the audience and ou
 r jury\, featuring cultural icon musician/actor Tom Waits\, screenwriter B
 illy Ray (*The Hunger Games*)\, Ed Begley Jr.\, and other distinguished ar
 tists. Visit our site for full jury bios and film details.\n\n**Schedule &
  Screening Blocks:**\n\nThe films are split across two 90-minute programs 
 (Block A and Block B). Intermissions offer plenty of time to enjoy a coffe
 e\, bite\, or wine tasting in downtown Healdsburg:\n\n**Option 1:** Block
  A at 1:30 PM – Block B at 4:30 PM\n\n**Option 2:** Block B at 4:30 PM 
 – Block A (Encore) at 7:30 PM\n\n**1:30 PM** – Block A\n\n**4:30 PM**
  – Block B\n\n**7:30 PM** – Block A (Evening Encore)\n\n**Tickets & 
 Pricing:**\n\n**Single Block:** $20\n\n**Day Pass (All Blocks):** $30
LOCATION: Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://healdsburgfilm.com/2026-audience-favorites-screening-nov-14-20
 26/
