  and textures of the autumn season at our gorgeous Apple Cottage. We are t
 hrilled to partner with the botanical experts from Flower Casita in Petalu
 ma to guide you through crafting your very own holiday masterpiece.\n\nUsi
 ng an array of fresh seasonal greens\, vibrant autumn leaves\, and rich bo
 tanical textures\, you will learn step-by-step techniques to construct a s
 tunning\, festive wreath. Your beautiful creation will be complete and rea
 dy to take home—perfectly timed to hang on your door and welcome guests 
