BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Repair Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T133000
UID:261021jwCxwapOtUmY6DLLVJu8dg
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a lamp\, small appliance\, textile\, or bike in ne
 ed of repair?\n\nBring it to the Repair Fair!‍ ‍\n\nVolunteers and spe
 cialized repair professionals will be on-hand to repair\\* your items.  
 We ask that you stay with your item while it's being fixed\, so you can le
 arn tips for future maintenance\, how to shop for repairable goods\, and e
 ven how to repair things yourself!  \n\nIf you’d like to bring an it
 em to repair\, please register the item here: https://www.reusealliance.or
 g/rf-reg \\(Pre-registering allows us to prepare for your item!\\)\n\nThis
  is a free public event.\n\n\\*We cannot guarantee your item\\(s\\) will b
 e repaired\, depending on the existing damage or breakage\, ability of vol
 unteer fixers\, and availability of materials for repair. Note: we cannot 
 work on microwaves\, repair screens on cell phones/computer devices\, or 
 perform any welding/brazing\, but we are happy to refer you to professiona
 ls who can. In addition\, the textile department is not able to perform th
 e following:\n\nReplacing zippers\n\nRepairing shoes\, leather\, or vinyl 
 materials\n\nPerforming alterations \\(making garments bigger/smaller\\)\n
 \nReplacing rivets/grommets\n\nHemming certain fabrics \\(stretchy fabric\
 , sleek/luxury fabrics e.g. prom dresses\\)\n\nIf you are in need of garme
 nt hemming\, we require that you please pin your garment to the desired le
 ngth before you arrive.\n\nJoin Us!\n\nDo you enjoy fixing things?  Or wa
 nt to help out in other ways?  We need you! Sign up or email volunteer@r
 eusealliance.org if you have any questions.
LOCATION:Central Santa Rosa Library
URL:https://www.reusealliance.org/events/santarosa-repairfair
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
