BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SKITZO - 45 YEARS OF GUT-WRENCHING THRASH METAL
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T223000
UID:261104V8ulq7bGIUGb6u3Q7JdPeQ
DESCRIPTION:SKITZO's 45th anniversary show featuring Skitzo\, Unprovoked\,
  Weapons and Ancestors Wrath at the Phoenix! SKITZO 45TH ANNIVERSARY — 4
 ½ DECADES OF METAL! Saturday\, November 14\, 2026 The Phoenix Theater —
  Petaluma\, CA 201 Keller Street\, Petaluma Doors/Show: 6 PM All Ages $15 
 Advance / $20 at the Door Get ready for a historic night of 45 years of SK
 ITZO ! In 1981\, the founding godfather of thrash metal\, Lance Ozanix \, 
 unleashed Skitzo —a band that would go on to carve its own path through 
 four and a half decades of heavy metal. Throughout his career\, Lance has 
 released an incredible 21 albums \, with a brand-new release coming in 202
 7 . Over the years\, Lance and Skitzo have shared stages with some of the 
 biggest and most influential names in metal\, including W.A.S.P.\, Misfits
 \, Tool\, Venom\, Death Angel\, Possessed\, Blind Illusion\, Vio-lence\, M
 achine Head\, Forbidden\, Saxon\, Raven \, and many more. Now\, on Novembe
 r 14th\, we're bringing past and present members of Skitzo together for on
 e massive night of metal history! SKITZO 45TH ANNIVERSARY LINEUP Drums: Li
 z Say • Jason Sullivan • Mike Carli • Drumin Dave • Noah Smith Gui
 tars: Jason Wright • Ron Klinger • Jason Spray • Kelly Gillis • Jo
 hn Crowhurst Bass: Sherri Stewart • Nate Clark MC: Buzz And that's not a
 ll— special guests will be joining us for this celebration! SPECIAL GUES
 T BANDS Ancestors Wrath OPENING Bill Scheffler & Mike Sloat's new band —
  Weapons 2nd Unprovoked — Sacramento and 3rd on the bill before Skitzo F
 our and a half decades. 21 albums. Countless stages. Generations of musici
 ans. One legendary night. Come celebrate 45 years of SKITZO with Lance Oza
 nix and the family of musicians who helped make the legacy what it is toda
 y. Saturday\, November 14\, 2026 — The Phoenix Theater\, Petaluma. 45 YE
 ARS OF SKITZO . ONE NIGHT. DON'T MISS IT! $15 Advance | $20 Door | All Age
 s | 6 PM
LOCATION:The Phoenix Theater
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1379717756948564/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
