DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T150000
UID:261114993hKlyGbUG97B5FF__R2w
DESCRIPTION:Free Admission for all ages! Shop handcrafted treasures and on
 e-of-a-kind finds from talented local artisans\, creative crafters\, and u
 nique resellers. From cozy knits to dazzling jewelry\, clever gadgets to i
 nspired artwork\, this festive marketplace has something for every stockin
 g and wish list. Savor fresh-baked goods\, warm comfort food\, and seasona
 l drinks as you browse. Let the spirit of the holidays surround you while 
 you discover gifts you won't find anywhere else. Avoid the last-minute rus
 h and leave with your holiday shopping wrapped up weeks before the festivi
 ties begin! Join us where Homegrown Holidays Begin and the magic of the se
 ason is handcrafted with love.
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/7th-annual-holiday-craft-faire/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
