DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
UID:261113G-9IDwDiHEK2P6WW5MoZKg
DESCRIPTION:As part of Healing With Play\, children are invited to create 
 a beautiful stained-glass-inspired butterfly in honor of someone they have
  lost. \n\nButterflies can represent transformation\, hope\, remembrance\,
  and the enduring nature of love. This gentle\, creative activity gives 
 children a way to express their feelings\, remember a loved one\, and crea
 te something meaningful to carry with them.
LOCATION:Children's Museum of Sonoma County
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/healing-with-play/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
