DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T180000
UID:2611129m2XsgjAREurVpnpOj_xPQ
DESCRIPTION:**Yoga Nidra: An Invitation to Deep Rest**\n\nGive yourself pe
 rmission to pause\, unwind\, and experience the restorative power of deep 
 relaxation.\n\nJoin experienced yoga and meditation instructor MaryEllen W
 hitton for a 90-minute experience combining gentle movement\, breathwork\,
  meditation\, and Yoga Nidra—a guided practice designed to promote profo
 und relaxation\, calm the nervous system\, and restore a sense of balance.
 \n\nYou'll be guided into a state of deep rest\, allowing your body to rel
 ax while your mind remains gently aware. No previous yoga experience is ne
 cessary. Simply come as you are and give yourself the gift of stillness.\n
