UID:2610314rRUYvxzEkakO1yktpHFeg
DESCRIPTION:Come learn the basics of archery from safety to form in a fun\
 , outdoor environment. Our certified instructors will help you develop you
 r skills and confidence on the range. This basic class is appropriate for 
 beginners as well as those who haven't picked up the bow in a while. Child
 ren under 13 must attend with an adult.\n\nTuition: $50\\* Use Code: PACSU
 N10 to receive $10 off! \\(not to be combined with any other offer\\)\n\n\
 \*When you become a Vilda Member\, you and a friend can attend all our yea
 r-round family classes for free! Memberships also make great gifts!! Learn
  more at https://www.vildanature.org/vilda-membership\n\nArchery Basics is
  part of Vilda\, which is dedicated to facilitating meaningful connections
  with the natural world. Vilda started in Fairfax\, California in 2008 and
  has been running programs since then\, now serving over 2000 kids a year 
 in Marin\, Sonoma\, and Tahoe. The organization is a 501c\\(3\\) non-profi
 t led by founder Mia Andler\, offering nature education\, youth programs\,
  homeschool programs\, and summer camps in several Bay Area communities an
 d in Tahoe and Truckee. Vilda recently won the prestigious Pacific Sun 202
 6 Award for "Best Summer Camp"!
LOCATION:Stafford Lake Park
URL:https://vilda.squarespace.com/family-adult#archerynov15
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
