UID:261027Ttovzp0WnEKW0qjWUDS0-w
DESCRIPTION:This free talk and hands-on session will enable you to:\n\n\\-
  Build a family tree in minutes\n\n\\- Search census and military records\
 n\n\\- Find birth\, marriage and death records\n\n\\- Explore historic new
 spapers\n\n\\- Trace your ancestry back hundreds of years\n\nYou will leav
 e the session with your family tree started! This event is presented by Mi
 chael Von der Porten\, a sixth-generation Sonoma County resident\, histori
 an\, researcher\, author\, and tour guide. This is a project from the West
 ern Sonoma County Historical Society. It will be preceded by an update by 
 the Historical Society\, including the latest about the West County Museum
  and the Luther Burbank Experiment Farm.\n\nWhat to Bring:\n\n\\- Full nam
 e of a parent\, grandparent\, or earlier ancestor\n\n\\- Birth date\n\n\\-
  Death date (if applicable)\n\n\\- Place of birth \n\nNote: We'll begin w
 ith deceased family members for privacy reasons.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
URL:http://Www.wschs.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
