 tluck luncheon and an educational program. Guests are welcome.\n\nOur spea
 ker for November is Bruce Horace Robinson\, a Sonoma County Master Gardene
 r\, Class of 2016. He will give a presentation on "Good Bugs\, Bad Bugs.
