 ollections: field guide to autobiography \\(The Operating System\, 2018\\)
 \, gutter rainbows \\(Querencia Press\, 2024\\)\, Suture \\(Cooper Dillon\
 , 2026\\) & Malocchia \\(White Stag\, 2026\\). Melissa served as Poet Laur
 eate for the City of Ukiah \\(2021-2024\\)\, and now lives in Northern Cal
