BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Follow the Clucking Money: Petaluma's Forever Bills
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T203000
UID:261111VEHd9EU9W0yD8W0UyIKN3A
DESCRIPTION:**When the chickens come home to roost\, who's paying for the 
 coop?**\n\nAt our first two workshops in the Follow the Clucking Money ser
 ies\, we cracked open the expenditure and revenue sides of Petaluma's budg
 et — all those tricky questions about where the money comes from and the
  tough trade-offs we make in deciding where it goes.\n\nIn this workshop\,
  we’re scratching beneath the surface of Petaluma’s long-term commitme
 nts\, including our roads that could use a little love. These promises kee
 p incubating year after year\, and some of them are hatching!\n\nWhat does
  Petaluma owe its future? And how do we pay the clucking bill?\n\nAt the w
 orkshop\, you'll get:\n\nA quick recap of workshops #1 and #2\, in case yo
 u missed them\n\nA first look at what we’ve learned about Petaluma’s l
 ong term commitments\n\nA friendly\, no‑jargon walkthrough of a case stu
 dy\n\nA chance to tell us what you want to explore next\n\nA sneak peek at
  upgrades to our tools at followthecluckingmoney.org\n\nYour voice matters
 . Your curiosity matters. And your participation can help shape what Petal
 uma if and how we choose to grow our revenues.\n\nCome learn\, laugh\, and
  help steer the flock.\n\nNo experience with budgets required — just cur
 iosity and an appetite. **Pizza will be served!** 🍕\n\n**Doors open at 
 6:45 pm!**
LOCATION:Petaluma Community Center
URL:https://www.tickettailor.com/events/urbanchat/2502636
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
