BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Longboard Vineyards Wine\, Dine & Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T190000
UID:261112mdF1cEEtvEq_a7EE6ms3dQ
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\nFea
 turing Harvest Band and Mamadios Philly Cheesesteak\n\nJoin us for a livel
 y Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in down
 town Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold sou
 lful food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the high-energy\, crowd-ple
 asing sounds of Harvest Band with the flavorful dishes of Mamadios Philly 
 Cheesesteak.\n\nHarvest Band brings a fun mix of danceable hits and famili
 ar favorites\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and social ev
 ening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s 
 wines by the glass or bottle while **Mamadios** brings authentic South **P
 hilly cheesesteaks** to Sonoma County. Made with love\, served with soul.\
 n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over
 -21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are wel
 come on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sono
 ma County night of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine avai
 lable for purchase Live music by Harvest Band\, Food by Mamadios Philly Ch
 eeseteak\, Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Stre
 et\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard VIneyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sun Kings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T220000
UID:2611129HWUMzs7H0iUAVqUfBnqIw
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the timeless music of The Beatles with The Sun Kings
 \, one of the nation's most acclaimed tribute bands. Now in their 25th yea
 r\, The Sun Kings deliver the hits and deep cuts with stunning accuracy\, 
 blending spot-on harmonies\, authentic instrumentation\, and electrifying 
 stage presence. From "She Loves You" to "Abbey Road\," The Sun Kings recre
 ate the magic of the Fab Four with a passion that's won them praise from c
 ritics and fans alike. Don't miss this unforgettable evening of music that
  captures both the spirit and sound of The Beatles\, live\, as you've neve
 r heard them before. Doors open at 6:30pm. Show at 7:30pm. Meet-&-Greet 9:
 30pm TICKETS: Seats within each zone are first-come-first-served. Ushers w
 ill seat you within your chosen zone upon arrival. \\(Zone C does not guar
 antee a seat.\\)
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/the-sun-kings/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Crossing Delancey - a Curtain Call Theatre Production
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T220000
UID:261108uSeueaEK3kCJiKFoJCXuRw
DESCRIPTION:She knows exactly the kind of guy she wants\, but grandmother 
 Bubbe and the matchmaker think differently. \n\nThis nostalgic favorite w
 as made into a beloved film in 1988. It is a love story about Izzy\, a tho
 roughly modern woman with not the greatest taste in men. Her grandmother B
 ubbe is desperate to get her married. Enter Henka\, the matchmaker with a 
 New York accent so sharp it could cut cheese\, and Sam Posner\, the pickle
  man with the heart of a poet. Will Izzy make the right choice? Doors open
  half an hour early for a photographic slideshow about New York’s Lower 
 East Side\, and some special snacks: Babka and Brooklyn Egg Creams. Don’
 t miss this delightful romantic comedy suitable for ages 8 and up. \n\nPl
 aywright: Susan Sandler\n\nDirector: Amanda Claiborne\n\nStarring: Kathy P
 ing-Rogers\, Kimy Martinez-Knight\, Nick Stewart\, Karen Clancy and Jake H
