  swap that ranges from Pumpkin Spice Snickerdoodles to Italian Hazelnut 
 Baci di Dama. Other recipes for the class to make and taste: Meyer Lemon C
 rinkle Cookies\, Dubai Chocolate Brownies\, Perfect Coconut Macaroons\, 
 White Chocolate Gingerbread Biscotti and of course\, Sugar Cookies de
 corated with Royal Icing.
LOCATION:Homeward Bound Of Marin Community Teaching Kitchen at Gilardi Tra
 ining & Events Center
URL:https://secure.qgiv.com/for/communitykitchenmasterform/event/community
 -class-112126/
