UID:2610231mqOyj5rh0Ovo_KC7aAlFg
DESCRIPTION:Susan Topf’s Yoga Hike balances a mix of easy hiking and gen
 tle yoga postures\, breath work and guided meditation\, no mat necessary. 
 The route varies on weather conditions and group interest\, typically cove
 ring 2-3 miles of varied terrain. All levels and ages welcome.\n\nTickets 
 are $20. Please wear weather-appropriate clothing to feel comfortable bein
 g in a natural setting and bring water \\(as needed\\). Meet outside the V
 isitor Center unless otherwise noted in the reminder email prior to the hi
 ke. Limited to 12 participants. \n\nSonoma County Resident? Free with a S
 eptember 2026 or newer Park Rx from a participating Sonoma County Medical 
 Provider. To sign up with a Park Rx\, please forward a PDF of your signed 
 Rx to alma@sonomaecologycenter.org for a sign up code.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/2026yoga-hikes
