UID:261022SNlGoSt6Uk67HvFCOw_1ng
DESCRIPTION:Disney's Frozen The Broadway Musical is based on the 2013 Disn
 ey animated film\, focusing on the estranged relationship between royal si
 sters Elsa and Anna. When Elsa loses control of her ice powers the kingdom
  is plunged into eternal winter\, Elsa flees\, and Anna embarks on a journ
 ey with Kristoff\, Sven\, and Olaf to find her sister and heal the kingdom
 .\n\nBook by Jennifer Lee\n\nMusic and Lyrics by Kristen Anderson-Lopez an
 d Robert Lopez\n\nDirected by Sarah Wintermeyer\n\nMusic and Vocal Directi
 on by Gordon Pyle\n\nChoreography by Jolene Johnson
LOCATION:SRJC Burbank Auditorium
URL:https://srjc.universitytickets.com/
