BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma Repair Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T130000
UID:261021ycG-HnTVP0C5l___Oe9dwg
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a lamp\, small appliance\, textile\, or bike in ne
 ed of repair?\n\nBring it to the Repair Fair!‍ ‍\n\nVolunteers and spe
 cialized repair professionals will be on-hand to repair\\* your items.  
 We ask that you stay with your item while it's being fixed\, so you can le
 arn tips for future maintenance\, how to shop for repairable goods\, and e
 ven how to repair things yourself!  \n\nIf you’d like to bring an it
 em to repair\, please register the item here: https://www.reusealliance.or
 g/rf-reg \\(Pre-registering allows us to prepare for your item!\\)\n\nThis
  is a free public event.\n\nThis event will also include a Holiday Swap & 
 Clothing Swap! Bring holiday decor\, clothing and accessories to share and
  take home something new-to-you. Please limit donations to 1 bag per perso
 n \\(clean and good condition only\, no undergarments or socks please\\)\,
  but take as much as you’d like! More about clothing swaps here.\n\n\\*W
 e cannot guarantee your item\\(s\\) will be repaired\, depending on the ex
 isting damage or breakage\, ability of volunteer fixers\, and availability
  of materials for repair. Note: we cannot work on microwaves\, repair scre
 ens on cell phones/computer devices\, or perform any welding/brazing\, bu
 t we are happy to refer you to professionals who can. In addition\, the te
 xtile department is not able to perform the following:\n\nReplacing zipper
 s\n\nRepairing shoes\, leather\, or vinyl materials\n\nPerforming alterati
 ons \\(making garments bigger/smaller\\)\n\nReplacing rivets/grommets\n\nH
 emming certain fabrics \\(stretchy fabric\, sleek/luxury fabrics e.g. prom
  dresses\\)\n\nIf you are in need of garment hemming\, we require that you
  please pin your garment to the desired length before you arrive.\n\nJoin 
 Us!\n\nDo you enjoy fixing things?  Or want to help out in other ways?  
 We need you! Sign up or email volunteer@reusealliance.org if you have any
  questions.
LOCATION:Petaluma Community Center
URL:https://www.reusealliance.org/events/petaluma-repairfair
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
