BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SIMRIT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T193000
UID:2610197eh02-4J7EWSNROIncg0sQ
DESCRIPTION:With multiple #1 albums and singles on the iTunes World Music 
 charts and Top 5 Billboard New Age placements\, **SIMRIT** moves effortles
 sly beyond genre – offering an evocative and transportive experience rid
 ing on a hypnotic\, deep-pocket groove. With a transcendental voice and a 
 sound that feels both timeless and fresh\, she fills theaters and concert 
 halls worldwide\, captivating audiences.\n\nDrawing upon her influences of
  traditional Greek\, North African and American folk\, Roots Reggae\, R&B\
 , Motown\, Psychedelic music and Rock with decades of study in Naad Yoga 
 – the ancient science of sound and consciousness – Simrit’s music ca
 rries a vibrational power that resonates deeply with her fans. Whether you
 ’re drawn by her unique story\, her radiant voice and presence\, or the 
 soul-stirring synergy of her band\, a SIMRIT concert is a transformational
  experience.\n\n**Saturday\, November 21st\, at 7:30PM.** Doors open at 6:
 30 PM.\n\n**Front Row:** $79\n\n**Rows 2-14 :** $49\n\n**Rows 15-19 :** $3
 4 (Includes fees.)
LOCATION:The Raven Performing Arts Theater
