 choices of choral music\, from "Bohemian Rhapsody" to Mozart! This season 
 we will honor Dolly Parton by singing her tender "Light of a Clear Blue Mo
 rning" as well as "Dirait-on" by Morten Lauridsen\, "Chorale: Hymn" by Kar
 l Jenkins\, "I'll be Seeing You" by Habermann and Fain\, "Ad Astra" by Nar
 verud\, "Time after Time" by Cyndi Lauper\, "O Love" by Elaine Hagenberg\,
  "The Awakening" by Martin and more!\n\nWe are so thrilled to be returning
  to the Barrel Room. Won't you please join us?\n\nSingChronous will be gue
 st artists at the Jacuzzi concert.
LOCATION:Jacuzzi Family Vineyards
