BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art Opening at Reichwage Winery: Paintings and Artisan Wood Creati
 ons
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T160000
UID:261112-VU5WGrtxk66YexxXBHs4g
DESCRIPTION:**Join us for an afternoon celebrating art\, nature\, and crea
 tivity with local artists Jann Aanestad and Ken Hower. Meet the artists\, 
 explore their work\, and enjoy light bites in the lovely setting of Reichw
 age Winery. Wine by the glass and tastings will also be available for purc
 hase.**\n\n***Resilience | Jann Aanestad***\n\nJann's colorful paintings c
 apture the beauty of nature\, the stories held in familiar places\, and qu
 iet moments in everyday life. Inspired by her own remarkable journey of re
 covery and renewal\, her work celebrates resilience\, the transformative p
 ower of light\, and the beauty that surrounds us.\n\n***Shaped by Nature |
  Ken Hower***\n\nKen creates beautiful artisan woodwork\, transforming wal
 nut\, oak\, manzanita\, and olive into one-of-a-kind bowls\, platters\, bo
 ards\, and decorative art. His pieces celebrate the natural grain\, rich t
 extures\, and flowing organic shapes of wood\, highlighting the unique cha
 racter and beauty of each piece.\n\nCome for the art\, stay for the atmosp
 here\, and discover the hidden gem that is Reichwage Winery.
LOCATION:Reichwage Winery
URL:https://www.reichwage.com/upcoming-events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
