BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boot Juice
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T180000
UID:261020xPkrTtYn3UKwoOLBEjHzCg
DESCRIPTION:A band that refuses to be locked into a single genre\, Boot Ju
 ice finds a sense of freedom in their ability to float from bluesy rock’
 n’roll to progressive bluegrass and back. Inspired by the likes of Railr
 oad Earth and soulful harmonies of Creedence Clearwater Revival\, Boot Jui
 ce curates a sound that is uniquely their own\, resulting in a layered and
  dynamic live performance. Boot Juice has been kickin' around the west sin
 ce 2016\, leaving audiences happy\, and dance floors sticky. The 7-piece b
 and features electric and acoustic guitars\, three vocalists\, bass\, drum
 s\, trumpet and alto saxophone. The band has its heart in Americana songwr
 iting\, with a rock’n’roll delivery that gets crowds moving. Boot Juic
 e plays music that will attempt to bring you to the street corner\, the ri
 ver side\, or the open highway. They have continued to produce new\, inter
 esting music that is hard to put a label on. It's been called a lot of thi
 ngs\; Rock\, Bluegrass\, Blues\, Folk\, Country. Whatever you want to call
  it\, they have found a sound that is uniquely their own\, weaving 3 or mo
 re part vocal harmonies with a rocking backing band\, and impressive lead 
 guitar licks.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern Novato
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1040222792?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
