UID:260902-2xW6wY2CECuTekE7QK9Dg
DESCRIPTION:You wrote the book. Now let's make it bring you clients. In 60
  minutes\, you'll see exactly how your book becomes your most powerful cli
 ent-attraction tool — and walk away with a plan for taking action today.
 \n\nWe'll look at the tools I use and what they can do for you.
