UID:261102DpwYePjvTUGRYj1BSQIYtw
DESCRIPTION:Crafted by himself\, Mayday hails from Birmingham. Taking insp
 iration from garage mixes his mother used to play in his early years and i
 nfusing them with a love of international music on a wider scale\, the 012
 1 native is set to bring his playful storytelling music to the world. The 
 self-proclaimed ‘Kingstanding Captain’ is one of the most exciting pro
 spects from the West Midlands to emerge in recent times. \n\nMayday is at 
 the forefront of Birmingham's next great Grime generation. His buzz is sta
 rting to travel in and out of the city and he’s being dubbed as the lead
 er going into the next decade. \n\n2025 saw Mayday bring together the new 
 Grime generation in Birmingham with the Awful Lotta Birmingham mixtape\, d
 efining the current and future era. He said 3 words and they became a move
 ment which the city is behind.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
