UID:261004904SRcrh4E-notWswzcGIQ
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Community Farmers' Market on Wednesdays is a cu
 rated selection of the best Sonoma County and the surrounding region has t
 o offer. We are dedicated to championing local food\, agriculture\, and ar
 t. Our mission is to elevate local artisans\, farmers\, and producers whil
 e supporting the diverse communities that embrace them. Established in 196
 7 and currently managed by Agricultural Community Events Farmers' Market\,
  we hold ourselves to the exceptional high standard that comes with the ro
 le of every Certified California Farmers Market.
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Veteran's Memorial Building
URL:https://www.ilovefarmersmarkets.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T170000
UID:260824OKkG0_MIqUi02fw6vC25Xw
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\n*Maple Magic* *& Winter Wonder* invites
  visitors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativ
 ity\, and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided wal
 ks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by t
 he changing landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the 
 sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experienc
 e the peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live Music Happy Hour - The Ukulele Ramblers - Open Uke Jam!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T190000
UID:260719nsByWwVYDkSjAHCxaY22mw
DESCRIPTION:Downtown Santa Rosa 'Golden Hour' 4-7p| Live music 5-7 p | $6 
 beers & $2 off wine |Tuesday-Saturday!\n\nFor people who like to party...b
 ut want to be home at a reasonable hour...Welcome to **Live Music - The Uk
 ulele Ramblers - Open Uke Jam!** Join us for a fun-filled evening of live 
 music and ukulele jamming at Barrel Proof Lounge. Bring your ukulele and s
 trum along with The Ukulele Ramblers\, a talented group of musicians who w
 ill be performing a mix of classic tunes and original songs. Whether you'r
 e a seasoned ukulele player or a beginner looking to learn\, this event is
  perfect for all music lovers. So mark your calendars and get ready to enj
 oy a night of great music and good vibes. See you there!\n\nOpen Uke jam h
 osted by your friendly neighborhood Ukulele collective.\n\nBring your sing
 ing voice and your Uke if you've got one\, and enjoy the comfortable\, wel
 coming space at Barrel Proof Lounge! 21+ Happy Hour Pricing 4-6pm All beer
 s - $6 + $2 off wine. Live Music 5-7pm 2 drink minimum\, please\n\n**www.U
 kuleleRamblers.net** Check out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts
  of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/live-music-happy-hour-the-ukulele-rambler
 s-open-uke-jam-tickets-1980136780414?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
