DESCRIPTION:*The Healdsburg Community\, including locals and visitors\, co
 mes together for the 15th annual Healdsburg Turkey Trot at 8:00am on Than
 ksgiving Day 2026.  Presented by the Rotary Club of Healdsburg Sunrise an
 d Healdsburg Running Company\, in partnership with the City of Healdsburg\
 , this event invites everyone\, from competitive runners to families with 
 strollers\, to join in the 5K fun.  Expect a lively crowd of up to 5\,000
  runners and walkers\, decked out in costumes\, festive hats\, and even tu
 rkey feathers.  Together we help Healdsburg’s high-achieving Scholar-At
 hletes LIVE LIKE DREW!  This slice of community is the best start to a Th
 anksgiving full of heart\, health\, and Healdsburg cheer.  Registration o
 pens September 1 at 5ktrot.com*
LOCATION:Start and Finish at Healdsburg Running Company
URL:http://5ktrot.com 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Samba no Pé
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T193000
UID:26041571F4AYGtJUClWR2uJB3glg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to feel the rhythm and energy of Rio de Janeiro! **
 Samba no Pé** (Samba in the Foot) is the captivating solo style of samba
  danced in the streets and at Carnival\, known for its rapid\, intricate f
 ootwork and infectious hip movements.\n\n**You will learn**\n\nThe Basic S
 tep: You will master the signature quick-quick-slow rhythm that defines Sa
 mba no Pé.\n\nArm & Hip Styling: You will learn how to add the authentic 
 flair\, movement\, and energy that makes Brazilian samba so captivating.\n
 \nTechnique & Posture: You will receive tips on proper body alignment to h
 elp you dance longer\, faster\, and more safely.\n\nRhythm & Musicality: Y
 ou will learn how to connect your movement directly to the irresistible be
 at of the bateria (the samba drum section).\n\nThis class is perfect for a
 nyone looking to connect with the vibrant spirit of Brazil\, improve coord
 ination\, and get a fantastic workout—all while learning the foundationa
 l steps of this iconic dance. No partner or prior dance experience is requ
 ired! Just bring your enthusiasm and comfortable shoes!\n\nDate & Time: Th
 ursdays @6:30PM – 7:30PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael\
 , CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowe
 d.
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8 • San Rafael\, CA 94903
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/samba-no-pe
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
