DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving Flight & Bites at Viansa Winery celebrates the ho
 liday season with a special tasting featuring three wines paired with fest
 ive small bites. The experience includes the 2025 Terra Collection Rosé o
 f Barbera from the North Coast paired with cranberry jam and Brie puff pas
 try bites\; the 2022 Altura Collection Nebbiolo from Los Olivos served wit
 h cornbread and Spanish chorizo topped with pear chutney\; and the 2021 Al
 tura Collection Red Blend from Sonoma Valley paired with bacon-wrapped\, b
 lue cheese-stuffed dates with red wine and onion jam.
LOCATION:Viansa Winery
