DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T140000
UID:261021jMAgNfvAjE2xSfVTKeaPMw
DESCRIPTION:At The Duckhorn Collection\, we believe memories are created w
 hen people gather\, share stories\, and truly connect. This wine and food 
 experience is served family-style\, featuring wines from across our portfo
 lio. Each course is designed to inspire exploration and play\, encouraging
  you to mix\, match and savor. You may even uncover an unexpected favorite
  along the way and an idea you can bring home with you!\n\nThis experience
  is offered Thursday through Sunday.\n\nMENU:\n\nGATHER\n\n2021 Goldeneye 
 Brut Rosé\n\nRoasted Beet Mosaic\n\nFeta\, Squash\, Chickpeas\, & Walnuts
 \n\n2023 Calera Mt. Harlan Chardonnay\n\nBrown Butter Potato Gnocchi\n\nBr
 ussels Sprouts\, Sous-vide Bacon\, Calvados & Sage\n\n2023 Duckhorn Rector
  Creek Merlot\n\nGRA Z E\n\nHeirloom Floriani Red Flint Corn Polenta\n\nWi
 ld Mushrooms and Aged Gouda Cheese\n\n2022 Paraduxx Rector Creek Cabernet 
 - Zinfandel Blend\n\nSmoked Beef Short Rib\n\nBaby Root Vegetable Gremolat
 a\n\n2023 Duckhorn Patzimaro Cabernet Sauvignon\n\nSAVOR\n\nPear Butter Ca
 ke\n\nGorgonzola Anglaise\, Spiced Pecans\, Caramel\n\nPairing: 2021 Caler
 a Viognier Doux\n\n- Please note this is a 21 and over experience\n\n- Gro
 up size: 2-6 guests﻿﻿\n\n- Duration: Please allow 90-120 minutes for t
 his experience
LOCATION:The Duckhorn Collection
URL:https://www.theduckhorncollection.com/pages/culinary
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
