DESCRIPTION:Community music workshops are a great way for musicians\, aspi
 ring musicians\, and music fans to engage the local community\, perform\, 
 learn\, and share musical experiences.  If you have a song you want to pl
 ay\, music you want to share\, are learning a new instrument\, or want to 
 meet other musicians\, the Community Music Workshops provide a clean\, wel
 l lit place for people to get together.  Even better\, the workshops are 
 free\, all ages\, and open to the public!
