DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Thanksgiving at Valentino’s Restaurant!  This Than
 ksgiving\, let Valentino’s Restaurant at Konocti Vista Casino take care 
 of the cooking! Whether you're gathering with family and friends at home o
 r joining us for a traditional holiday dinner\, we've got something delici
 ous planned for you. Thanksgiving Dinner | November 26 Thursday | 2 PM –
  8 PM Join us at Valentino’s Restaurant for a traditional Thanksgiving d
 inner featuring: • Sliced Turkey • Mashed Potatoes & Gravy • Dinner 
