DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T160000
UID:261106zIsV8XgTmkCnrSuRjph6LQ
DESCRIPTION:Skip the big-box stores and shop local this Black Friday! Join
  us at Dutton-Goldfield for our festive Holiday Makers Mart\, featuring so
 me of Sonoma County’s finest local artisans and makers. From the butcher
  and the baker to the candlestick maker (quite literally!) and so much mor
 e\, you'll find unique\, handcrafted gifts and holiday goodies for everyon
 e on your list.\n\nSip on your favorite DG wines while you shop\, support 
 local businesses\, and kick off the holiday season with us. Good wine\, gr
 eat gifts\, and a little holiday cheer—what more could you ask for?\n\nN
 ovember 27th 10 AM - 4:30 PM
LOCATION:Dutton-Goldfield Winery
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/holiday-maker-s-mart-at
 -dutton-goldfield-winery/20339320/2026-11-27T10
