BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rooted
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T220000
UID:261106pFWe_KozMUadawtbPbM_Sw
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, Spreckels Theatre Company offers a heart
 warming alternative to traditional seasonal fare with *Rooted*\, a story a
 bout the messy\, fierce love that keeps us grounded. An intelligent\, gent
 le comedy by Deborah Zoe Laufer\, *Rooted* plays Nov. 27 – Dec.13!\n\nEm
 ery is perfectly content living in her beloved treehouse\, completely isol
 ated from the world\, communing with her plants. Meanwhile\, down on the g
 round\, her sister Hazel is thoroughly miserable\, slaving away at a dead-
 end diner job just to survive and financially support Emery’s eccentric 
 lifestyle. Looking on from the sidelines\, Luanne is yearning for somethin
 g\, anything to bring true meaning into her life.\n\n﻿The sisters' fragi
 le ecosystem is completely upended when Emery’s YouTube videos documenti
 ng her plant experiments unexpectedly go viral. Almost overnight\, her dig
 ital musings accidentally incite a full-blown CULT(!). As throngs of devot
 ed truth-seekers congregate below the treehouse\, the lives of all three w
 omen are plunged into chaos\, compelling each woman to choose their own pa
 th and find their bliss.\n\n*Pick-Your-Price Night: purchase sliding scale
  tickets starting at $10 each for the opening Friday night\, Nov. 27th.*
LOCATION:Spreckels Center for the Performing Arts - Bette Condiotti Experi
 mental Theatre
URL:https://spreckelsonline.com/show/2026-27-season/rooted/ 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MEAN DAVE headlines Friday Night Comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T220000
UID:261106lp1Bifq8lUiu7LeA-8RH8w
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa with Mean 
 Dave\n\nStand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa VIP TABLES NOW AVAILABLE! S
 nag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own private call button to
  summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (or a bottle of wine)
  for only $95! Every Friday night hilarious comedians from The Bay Area an
 d beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick around after for late-night
  karaoke!\n\nFresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThis Week: Host: Josh A
 rgyle Paulie Escobedo Headliner: Mean Dave\n\nMEAN DAVE is a stand-up come
 dian. He is a regular at Cobb's Comedy Club\, Punch Line in SF and Sacrame
 nto and Rooster T. Feathers and has opened for headliners such as Judy Ten
 uta\, Big Jay Oakerson\, Allan Havey\, Tom Rhodes\, Neil Hamburger\, Brent
  Morin\, Bret Ernst and most importantly\, Barry Sobel. Most of Dave's lif
 e has been littered with utter disappointment and flat out betrayal that o
 nly a sarcastic\, cynical sense of humor can remedy. Hopefully this inform
 ation helps you in your decision as to whether Mean Dave's comedy will hel
 p you attain laughter as you hopefully progress through futile existence. 
 21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20door Check out **BarrelProofLounge.
 com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/mean-dave-headlines-friday-night-comedy-i
 n-downtown-santa-rosa-tickets-2001406381363?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
