BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T170000
UID:261023wyKWoRzhTEC3lqQbbRn1PQ
DESCRIPTION:**New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly orig
 inal\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and 
 athletically stunning skill.**\n\n**Sonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 
 –** This 2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La
  Lune Brille’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the i
 ntimate and charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the W
 inter moon and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the s
 ky\, she must find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she 
 encounters mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child
  pleasing origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acro
 bats\, and clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere w
 ith celestial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all
  ages.\n\nSpectators for all showings are invited to the European style ci
 rcus tent to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Corne
 rstone Sonoma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \
 n\nThe event will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half
  hour show.\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Corner
 stone Sonoma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase
  online at thenewmooncircus.com.\n\nIndividual ticket prices start at $40.
  Front row (VIP)\, options start at $65. Find showtimes and more details a
 t thenewmooncircus.com. Early booking is encouraged for this highly antici
 pated event.
LOCATION:CORNERSTONE SONOMA - Under the Big Top Tent  
URL:https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
