 shoots\, and whatever else happens to be ready this month. Participants ge
 t to take home a box of vegetables and fruits they pick themselves.\n\n$50
  per person.
LOCATION:The Sea Ranch Lodge
URL:https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
