DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T180000
UID:261111oH4NAraSHk68DNUie6aTAw
DESCRIPTION:Featuring vocalist Stella Heath\, pianist Neil Angelo Fontano\
 , and Robby Elfman on reeds\, this dynamic trio brings a fresh perspective
  to the Great American Songbook and classic jazz standards. With playful i
 mprovisation\, rich musical interplay\, and an infectious sense of swing\,
  the trio celebrates the timeless music of jazz’s golden era.
