DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T235900
UID:261110_rXAqH1MIkm-9ttjDmOQxQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable evening of burlesque\, pole dance
 \, and variety entertainment in Sebastopol! Thotty’s Naughty Revue bring
 s together an exciting rotating lineup of local and traveling performers f
 or an intimate\, up-close show featuring incredible pole artistry\, sensua
 l dance\, glamour\, and the art of the tease.\n\nIn collaboration with Wax
  Poetic\, the evening continues beyond the stage with thoughtfully curated
  vinyl\, vintage-cool vibes\, music\, mingling\, and dancing. Enjoy the pe
 rformances\, stay for the music\, and make a night of it!\n\nOur November 
 lineup features:\n\nTina Kristine\, Kim\, Vylet Vanse\, Shiree Amour\, Wil
 ee Walrus\, Audrey Jane\, Countess Malfaz\, and Twerk A Rella!\n\nDoors op
 en at 7:00 PM Show starts at 7:30 PM at the Main Street Theater in Sebasto
 pol\, an intimate up close experience. Tickets start at $30 for general ad
 mission\, $35 for 2nd row seating and $40 for the up close and immersive e
 xperience of the front row.\n\nMAIN STREET THEATER 104 N. MAIN ST. SEBASTO
 POL
LOCATION:MAIN STREET THEATER
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/thottys-naughty-revue-featuring-wax-poeti
 c-tickets-2004170010452
