BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opera Film:  ŒDIPE\, Bregenz Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T154500
UID:260926hDuT6hWMMkewRMlPOLelpw
DESCRIPTION:It is George Enescu's only opera: the Romanian composer strugg
 led for years with the greatest of all tragedies\, the myth of Oedipus\, w
 ho kills his father and marries his mother because the gods have predestin
 ed it so. The new Bregenz production of the work is directed by the intern
 ationally renowned director Andreas Kriegenburg.\n\nBased on the ancient G
 reek myth and Sophocles' tragedies\, the opera follows King Laïos's curs
 ed fate\, Œdipe unknowingly fulfilling the prophecy to kill his father 
 and marry his mother\, and his eventual redemption after decades of isolat
 ion.
LOCATION:Jarvis Conservatory
URL:https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/oedipe
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
