BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gather & Graze Family-Style Tasting Experience at The Duckhorn Col
 lection
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T140000
UID:261021VUtqaMYENEydhhAwP0d3lw
DESCRIPTION:At The Duckhorn Collection\, we believe memories are created w
 hen people gather\, share stories\, and truly connect. This wine and food 
 experience is served family-style\, featuring wines from across our portfo
 lio. Each course is designed to inspire exploration and play\, encouraging
  you to mix\, match and savor. You may even uncover an unexpected favorite
  along the way and an idea you can bring home with you!\n\nThis experience
  is offered Thursday through Sunday.\n\nMENU:\n\nGATHER\n\n2021 Goldeneye 
 Brut Rosé\n\nRoasted Beet Mosaic\n\nFeta\, Squash\, Chickpeas\, & Walnuts
 \n\n2023 Calera Mt. Harlan Chardonnay\n\nBrown Butter Potato Gnocchi\n\nBr
 ussels Sprouts\, Sous-vide Bacon\, Calvados & Sage\n\n2023 Duckhorn Rector
  Creek Merlot\n\nGRA Z E\n\nHeirloom Floriani Red Flint Corn Polenta\n\nWi
 ld Mushrooms and Aged Gouda Cheese\n\n2022 Paraduxx Rector Creek Cabernet 
 - Zinfandel Blend\n\nSmoked Beef Short Rib\n\nBaby Root Vegetable Gremolat
 a\n\n2023 Duckhorn Patzimaro Cabernet Sauvignon\n\nSAVOR\n\nPear Butter Ca
 ke\n\nGorgonzola Anglaise\, Spiced Pecans\, Caramel\n\nPairing: 2021 Caler
 a Viognier Doux\n\n- Please note this is a 21 and over experience\n\n- Gro
 up size: 2-6 guests﻿﻿\n\n- Duration: Please allow 90-120 minutes for t
 his experience
LOCATION:The Duckhorn Collection
URL:https://www.theduckhorncollection.com/pages/culinary
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Park Rx-Group Fitness Hikes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T130000
UID:261014Dgu-s8hSV0SFfVM2dn_7MA
DESCRIPTION:Part of our Hiking for Fitness program\, these free\, moderate
 -to-strenuous group hikes are geared to keep you motivated through the col
 d season. Please note that these routes might change. RSVP is required. Pa
 rking fees apply. Heavy rains cancel.\n\n11/28 - Goodspeed to Nattkemper b
 ench: 3.8 mi\, 1240 ft elevation\, meets @ Goodspeed lot\n\n12/12 - Vista 
 Trail Loop \\(clockwise\\): ~4.2 mi\, 600ft elevation\, meets @ main lot\n
 \n12/26 - Hillside to Neptune picnic table: 4.4 mi\, 970-ft elevation\, me
 ets @ White Barn lot
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/parkrx-grouphike2026
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga on Tower Hill
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T093000
UID:261011Tqdn7I7hbkmPiYdpmaIhCw
DESCRIPTION:Set against the sweeping hills above Tomales Bay\, our outdoor
  yoga sessions offer a peaceful setting to move\, breathe\, and connect. A
 s morning light spreads across the water\, each class invites you to groun
 d yourself in stillness and balance\, surrounded by the natural rhythms of
  Point Reyes landscape.\n\nLed by experienced instructors from The Yoga Po
 st Petaluma. These sessions are designed for all levels and focuses on min
 dful movement with fresh air and open space\, encouraging balance and grou
 nding while improving overall health and wellness.\n\nClasses take place e
 very Saturday morning at 9:30am on Tower Hill\, weather permitting. Mats a
 re provided and participation is complimentary for overnight guest. The ge
 neral public is welcome to join for a small fee.
LOCATION:Lodge at Marconi
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/yoga-on-tower-hill/2012
 1347/2026-11-28T09
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:With Regret: Comedy in the Deerfield Cave
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T203000
UID:260930Ibb6tfaNKE2pJxmDnT3-YA
DESCRIPTION:Experience a one-of-a-kind night of entertainment as With Regr
 et Presents transforms the spectacular subterranean wine cave at Deerfield
  Ranch Winery into an intimate\, premium comedy club. This exclusive showc
 ase features a hand-picked lineup of the Bay Area’s top stand-up comedia
 ns performing live inside the winery's stunning cave tunnels. Guests can e
 njoy award-winning local wines and delicious dining options available insi
 de the cave before the laughter begins. Perfect for a unique date night or
  an unforgettable evening out in the valley. Doors open at 5:00 PM for win
 e and food\, and the comedy showcase kicks off promptly at 7:00 PM. Seatin
 g inside the cave is strictly limited. Advanced ticket purchase is highly 
 recommended.
LOCATION:Deerfield Ranch Winery
URL:https://luma.com/qmz0ndo5
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T170000
UID:2608249Cp1298SfkSBU7W49aE8PA
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\n*Maple Magic* *& Winter Wonder* invites
  visitors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativ
 ity\, and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided wal
 ks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by t
 he changing landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the 
 sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experienc
 e the peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Beginners 2 - Saturdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T120000
UID:260407qTxIQXiLA0qT0zvin_gyWA
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your salsa to the next level? You’ve mastered 
 the basics\, now it’s time to add some flair and fluidity to your salsa 
 dancing.\n\nPre-requisite: Salsa Beginners 1 – You know your basic steps
 \, left turn\, right turn\, cross-body lead\, and you hold your frame.\n\n
 **What You’ll Learn**\n\nWe’ve curated a curriculum designed to build 
 your confidence and your “social dance” vocabulary:\n\n**• The Cross
  Body Lead (CBL) Series:** Master both **Inside and Outside Turns**\, the 
 essential building blocks for moving your partner across the floor with gr
 ace.\n\n**• The “I Turn – You Turn”:** A classic social dance stap
 le that develops timing and hand-change coordination.\n\n**• The Walk-Th
 rough:** Learn how to transition smoothly through the dance space without 
 breaking your rhythm.\n\n**• Footwork & Shine:** We’ll break down the 
 footwork pattern that adds personality to your “shines.”\n\n**Techniqu
 e & Artistry**\n\nDancing is about more than just where your feet go. In t
 his level\, we dive deeper into the “how”:\n\n**• The Frame:** Under
 stand the “tension and compression” needed to lead and follow clearly 
 without using muscle.\n\n**• Upper Body Mechanics:** Learn how to isolat
 e your ribcage and shoulders to move with that authentic Latin soul.\n\n**
 • Connection:** Developing a “heavy” but responsive arm connection t
 o ensure your partner feels every lead.\n\n**Important Details**\n\n**• 
 No dance experience required:** Whether you’ve never danced before or it
 ’s been a while\, you’re welcome here!\n\n**• No partner necessary:*
 * Come solo or bring a friend—either way\, you’ll have plenty of oppor
 tunities to dance.\n\n**•** Please wear **non-marking shoe soles:** This
  helps us keep our dance floor in great condition.\n\nDate & Time:\n\n**Th
 ursdays 7:30 PM**\n\n**Saturday 11:00 AM**\n\nInstructor: Lucie Ebnerova\n
 \nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minu
 tes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-2/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Beginner Marin – Saturday
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T110000
UID:260317oi4vrc6oiEioQD8jDA4ZDA
DESCRIPTION:**Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?** Join on 
 on Saturday – Salsa Beginner Marin\n\nAre you a beginner who’s always 
 wanted to learn salsa? Salsa classes are designed to help you build a stro
 ng foundation. In this class\, you’ll learn the fundamental footwork\, p
 ractice the basic turns\, and understand the essential body movement that 
 will make you feel confident on the dance floor. This class is perfect for
  anyone ready to learn the techniques and foundational steps needed to sta
 rt their salsa journey.\n\nSalsa is fun\, and we make learning it stress-f
 ree! Our relaxed\, beginner-friendly class is the ideal starting point. Yo
 u don’t need a partner\, nor any dance experience!\n\nIn this class you 
 will learn:\n\nBasic directional steps that form the foundation of salsa.\
 n\nProper frame for comfortable and effective partner-work.\n\nSimple\, ea
 sy-to-remember turn patterns.\n\nGet ready to learn the fundamentals and h
 ave a great time!\n\n**Details:**\n\n**No partner necessary**—rotations 
 ensure everyone dances\n\nPlease wear **non-marking shoes** to protect t
 he floor\n\nArrive 10 minutes early\; warm up and settle in\n\n**When:** 
 Saturday\, 10:00 am – 11:00 am\n\n**Where:** 4140 Redwood Highway #8\, 
 San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8\, San Rafael\, CA
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-saturday/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
