DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T201500
UID:261019OK1AL84aDE68qxne7g3Mqw
DESCRIPTION:**December 2 – January 6 (6 weeks)**\n\n**7:15 PM – 8:15 P
 M 4140 Redwood Highway #8\, San Rafael\, CA**\n\nReady to take your salsa 
 to the next level? This 6-week salsa intermediate Marin series is designed
  for dancers who already know the basics (timing\, basic steps\, and simpl
 e turns\, etc.) and want to build the confidence and versatility to shine 
 on the social dance floor.\n\n**In this class\, you’ll:**\n\nDevelop ada
 ptability so you can flow with different partners and music.\n\nRefine you
 r footwork and styling for sharper expression.\n\nMaster more complex turn
  patterns and combinations.\n\nStrengthen your lead and follow for smoothe
 r\, more connected dancing.\n\n**What to Expect:** Steven’s teaching sty
 le blends structure with fun\, creating a supportive space where you’ll 
 be challenged but never overwhelmed. Each week builds on the last\, helpin
 g you progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n
 \n**Details:**\n\nNo partner necessary — rotations ensure everyone gets 
 to dance.\n\nPlease wear **non-marking shoe soles** to protect the floor
 .\n\nArrive 10 minutes early to warm up and get settled.\n\nDate & Time: W
 ednesdays @ 7:15PM – 8:15PM\n\nInstructor: Steven Khuong\n\nAddress: 414
 0 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin 
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/intermediate-salsa-wednesday-715-pm/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
