 asses\n\nExperience Level\n\nIntermediate and Advanced\n\nAges\n\n18 and o
 lder\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$325\n\nIn this studio course\, students wil
 l bring their paintings or drawings and work in a community environment wi
 th other artists. This is an opportunity to expand your work alongside oth
 er students\, learn from each other\, share ideas\, and participate in cri
 tiques guided by the instructor. Each student will receive as much instruc
 tion as they want and can work with the instructor to develop projects bas
 ed on their next level of learning. Each week there will be a critique at 
