BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ann Halen + Bad Reputation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T190000
UID:261022iwZY1ETkaUOFCelhzNIHQQ
DESCRIPTION:Date: Friday\, December 4\, 2026\n\nTime: Doors 6 PM | Show 7
  PM\n\nTickets: $10 Adv | $15 Door | Free for Coyote Sonoma Club Members\n
 \nFood Vendor: Smoked & Baked Pizza\n\nLocation: Coyote Sonoma - 44F Mill 
 Street\, Healdsburg CA\, 95448\n\nAnn Halen is a Van Halen tribute band ha
 iling from Novato\, California—lead by singer extraordinaire Annie Scher
 er—dedicated to performing song-for-song album recreations with note-for
  note accuracy. The band focuses exclusively on the David Lee Roth era Van
  Halen tunes\, and has been performing to rave reviews ever since their in
 ception. With an awesome female lead singer and a roster of accomplished\,
  virtuosic musicians\, they are an amazing tribute to one of the greatest 
 bands in rock-and-roll history.\n\nBad Reputation pays tribute to Joan Jet
 t and the Blackhearts with precision and love—all the songs that you wan
 t to hear\, plus some that you need to hear. \n\nThe musicians behind Bad
  Reputation have decades of experience\, as well as youthful exuberance.\n
 \nAs Joan Jett\, RJ Rocket \\(aka Robin Pfefer\\) has been a NorCal fixtur
 e since the 80s. She's performed with Wild Brides\, Yo! Pizzaface\, No Use
  For A Name\, Dr. Obvious\, Cheap Date 13\, and more. She's produced recor
 ds for Cheap Date 13\, Grit & Pluck\, Buzzard\, Megan McElroy\, and others
 . She brings a true Rock and Roll heart to Bad Reputation.\n\nGuitarist C
 onnor Skünck Jr.- owner of the coolest guitar in the world\, as well as m
 ore hair than the rest of the band combined. Definitely punches above his 
 weight class.\n\nBassist Kevin “Popeye” Dee - Played trumpet at Katy P
 erry's sweet 16 birthday\, then a chance encounter with Tom Waits convince
 d him in a roundabout way to play electric bass.\n\nDrummer Nicky Thunders
  -Lives large\, plays big\, plus red beard. What's not to love?
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/ann-halen-with-bad-reputation-124-p262.a
 spx
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
