BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Candlelight Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T213000
UID:261011n0f8_fO3V0Cm0n4G82ZABw
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join Cantiamo Sonoma for a cherished holiday 
 tradition: **A Candlelight  Christmas**\, an evening of exquisite a capp
 ella music spanning the Renaissance to contemporary composers.\n\nThis yea
 r’s celebration is especially meaningful as Cantiamo presents a new comm
 ission\, *The Lamb*\, by acclaimed Norwegian composer and pianist **Ola 
 Gjeilo**. We are thrilled to share this beautiful new work with you and to
  celebrate the continuing tradition of bringing extraordinary choral music
  to our community.\n\nFollowing the concert\, please join us for a festive
  **champagne reception**\, where we can gather\, celebrate the season\, an
 d share our appreciation for the music and community that make Cantiamo s
 o special.
LOCATION:St. Seraphim Of Sarov Orthodox Church
URL:https://cantiamosonoma.org/events
