SUMMARY:Friday Art Classes at OCA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T123000
UID:261002aHv2o1c74kKkOcydgwkS3g
DESCRIPTION:Our Fall Session is open to all experience levels. Learn a var
 iety of art techniques in a supportive community setting. Instructors incl
 ude Patrick Fanning\, Linda Kammer\, Lesley Pickford and John James. This 
 semester focuses on Drawing in Perspective\, Watercolor Cityscapes\, Drawi
 ng the Head and Acrylic Explorations. Come have fun creating art with us o
 n Fridays! $175 for nonmembers\, $150 for members\, includes 12 classes. L
 earn more at https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/oava
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1608142840856421/1608142864189752/?act
 ive_tab=about
