DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a ta
 sting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acr
 oss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll 
 and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new so
 unds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**The Musers** Rooted in rich 
 musical traditions and diverse acoustic styles\, The Musers blend powerf
 ul vocals\, intricate guitar work\, and lively rhythms into a genre-crossi
 ng\, high-spirited sound. \n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welco
 me\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a re
 servation. We are dog and family friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/event/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
