  Carl Jordan \n\nStarring Libby Oberlin as Janis Joplin\n\nFeaturing Aja 
 Gianola\, Jeffrie Givens\, Michelle Louise\, Simone Mosely\, and Skylaer P
 alacois \n\n**Michelle Louise will be playing the role of Janis Joplin on
  Saturday 12/5\, Thursday 12/10 and Thursday 12/19**\n\n‘A Night with Ja
 nis Joplin’ runs December 4th - 20th\, 2026\n\nThursday - Saturdays 7:30
 pm\n\nSundays 2:00pm\n\nFor Tickets Call 707.204.9990 or visit sonomaartsl
 ive.org
