BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Proud Mary: A Creedence Queerwater Revival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T150000
UID:261020lq6G9nFKyUa-H4Dq1vDYCQ
DESCRIPTION:Proud Mary is the world's queerest tribute to the much-loved '
 60s-'70s rock band Creedence Clearwater Revival. The band performs CCR's m
 any hits\, including "Fortunate Son\," "I Heard It Through the Grapevine\,
 " "Bad Moon Rising\," "Down on the Corner\," and\, of course\, "Proud Mary
 ." Plus many more!\n\nProud Mary is a new project brought to you by member
 s of the San Francisco Bay Area's most popular tribute bands and original 
 rock groups. Led by the soulful voice of lead singer\, McKenzie Fulkerson-
 Jones \\(they/them\\)\, the group serves up a playful yet fierce take on C
 CR's music\, with a side of rainbows\, tassels and glitter. Joined by Lind
 a Moody \\(she/her\\) on guitar\, Tori Fulkerson-Jones \\(she/her\\) on ba
 ss and Jai Bird \\(she/her\\) on drums\, Proud Mary will put a spell on yo
 u at their "Queerwater Revival."\n\nProud Mary delivers fresh performances
  of CCR's greatest hits and welcomes everyone to join in. Between the icon
 ic guitar licks you expect and some surprising and interactive theatrical 
 elements\, you're sure to be on your feet\, grooving and belting along to 
 every song.\n\nProud Mary is available for booking at music venues\, festi
 vals\, private and public parties\, and corporate events.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern Novato
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1040023846?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
