BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Holiday Spectacular - Duke Ellington's Harlem Nutcracker
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T190000
UID:260922H84QGrYxH0uyY1GXxNJMlw
DESCRIPTION:Marcus Shelby’s Big Band presents Duke Ellington’s “Harl
 em Nutcracker\,” an exciting holiday celebration that brings Duke Elling
 ton and Billy Strayhorn’s iconic jazz interpretation to life. The evenin
 g features a live reading of the beloved holiday story\, vintage film clip
 s\, and the dynamic sound of a live big band. Experience the familiar magi
 c of “The Nutcracker” through the rich rhythms\, colors\, and spirit o
 f Harlem jazz. It’s an unforgettable evening of music\, storytelling\, a
 nd holiday tradition for audiences of all ages.
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theatre
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/holiday-spectacular-duke-ellingtons-har
 lem-nutcracker/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Galbreath Mushroom Blitz 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T143000
UID:260910hAhiCxeD1U2d4cC3Mh0T4A
DESCRIPTION:Wild mushrooms are indicators of soil and air quality\, and su
 pport plant growth and communication. For the 8th consecutive year\, stude
 nts and the community will comb the hills of the Galbreath Preserve to col
 lect as many fungal species as possible. Join us and build identification 
 and sustainable harvesting skills while adding to our research database.
LOCATION:Galbreath Wildlands Preserve
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/GalbreathMycoBlitz
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma River Upstream High Tide Paddle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T121500
UID:26021193yKCENYoUaGRjAUN6Hl6Q
DESCRIPTION:When the tide is high\, the Petaluma River opens into a quiete
 r\, greener world.\n\nJoin The Floathouse crew at their central downtown d
 ock for a gentle\, guided paddle upstream\, timed to higher tides that all
 ow access beyond the downtown channel and into a tranquil tidal slough. Wi
 th extra water beneath us\, we’re able to glide into calm\, lush stretch
 es of the river that are normally out of reach.\n\nThis unhurried paddle h
 ighlights the natural beauty of the Petaluma River’s brackish\, tidal wa
 terway. Watch for great egrets\, blue herons\, snowy egrets\, turtles bask
 ing along the banks\, and abundant plant life. The calm water and peaceful
  surroundings create a deeply grounding experience—many guests say they 
 feel their stress melt away within minutes.\n\nAlong the way\, knowledgeab
 le guides share stories of the river’s ecology and human history\, offer
 ing insight into how this upper channel has shaped—and continues to shap
 e—Petaluma. It’s a rare opportunity to experience how close wild natur
 e lives to the heart of downtown.\n\nBeginner-friendly. Sit-on-top kayaks 
 and all gear provided.
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/petaluma-river-upstream
 -high-tide-paddle/18032819/2026-12-06T10
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Meet Me in St. Louis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T163000
UID:261112YtVuzU6j9kyPA2gpK999dA
DESCRIPTION:Meet Me in St. Louis is a heartwarming\, nostalgic musical tha
 t brings the charm and excitement of turn-of-the-century America to life. 
 Set in 1904 on the eve of the St. Louis World’s Fair\, the story follows
  the Smith family through a year of romance\, humor\, and unexpected chang
 e. At its center is the spirited and lovestruck Esther Smith\, whose bloss
 oming romance unfolds alongside her sisters’ own adventures and the fami
 ly’s hopes for the future. Featuring beloved songs like “The Trolley S
 ong\,” “Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\,” and “The Boy Nex
 t Door\,” this classic musical overflows with warmth\, wit\, and unforge
 ttable melodies. Rich with period detail\, lively ensemble numbers\, and t
 ender family moments\, Meet Me in St. Louis celebrates community\, resilie
 nce\, and the enduring power of home. Audiences will be swept up in its co
 lorful seasonal settings—from summer dances to a magical Christmas Eve
 —culminating in the dazzling anticipation of the World’s Fair. Perfect
  for theatregoers of all ages\, this timeless musical offers romance\, lau
 ghter\, and a joyful reminder that even in times of change\, love and fami
 ly light the way forward. MEET ME IN ST. LOUIS is presented by arrangement
  with Concord Theatricals on behalf of Tams-Witmark LLC. concordtheatrical
 s.com
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1599145155293030/1599145208626358/?act
 ive_tab=about
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
