 ily throughout the day. You’ll also find exclusive opportunities to stoc
 k up for the holidays\, with limited offers and cheerful surprises you won
 ’t want to miss. And who knows — there might even be a few reindeer ga
 mes along the way. \n\nSo bundle up\, bring your favorite people\, and com
 e raise a glass to a little Bundschu cheer. \n\nDATE: Sunday December 6th 
 \n\nTIME: Noon-4 \n\nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery \\+ Abbot’s Pass
 age Winery & Mercantile. This is a “CRAWL” so stop by one\, or both wi
 neries and maybe even somewhere in between! \n\nTICKETS AVAILABLE OCT 1: C
 lub members receive two \\(2\\) free tickets per membership. Additional ti
 ckets are $45pp. Guests under 21 are free to attend.
