BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Holiday Family Feud - Comedians vs Audience!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T210000
UID:261107zh0GYe2Ct02fEzon8cNneg
DESCRIPTION:Holiday Family Feud returns! Comedians take on the audience in
  a festive\, chaotic\, prize-filled showdown. Free event in Downtown Santa
  Rosa.\n\nGet Ready for the Funniest “Office Xmas Party” in Downtown S
 anta Rosa\n\nIt’s back… and this time it’s FESTIVE.\n\nJoin us for H
 oliday Family Feud – Comedians vs Audience \, the annual end-of-year sho
 wdown where Sonoma County comics battle it out against you —the audience
 —in a fast-paced\, ridiculous\, laugh-until-you-cry night of survey ques
 tions\, holiday chaos\, and friendly smack talk.\n\nThink: The energy of F
 amily Feud The absurdity of a stand-up greenroom The spirit of a holiday p
 arty And YOU on the team that could take home prizes\n\nWhat to Expect •
  Comedians vs Audience Teams – They’re funny… but you’re competiti
 ve. • Holiday-themed questions\, surprises & twists • Real prizes\, re
 al bragging rights • A room full of laughter and chaotic cheer • Absol
 utely NO COVER – Free to play\, free to watch\, free to scream “GOOD A
 NSWER!” at strangers\n\nIt’s one of the most fun nights of the season 
 — part game show\, part comedy night\, part “why did I say that out lo
 ud?” Whether you’re joining a team or just soaking it all in\, you’l
 l have a blast.\n\nPerfect For: • Groups of friends looking for a holida
 y hang • Local comics treating this like their annual misfit Christmas p
 arty • Competitive people who love winning free stuff • Anyone who wan
 ts a fun\, weird\, joyful Thursday night in Downtown Santa Rosa Doors open
  early — grab a drink\, claim your spot\, and get ready to feud. Holiday
  Family Feud: Comedians vs Audience\n\nThursday\, December 10th · 7PM Bar
 rel Proof Lounge – 501 Mendocino Ave\, Downtown Santa Rosa FREE Event ·
  21+\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good time
 s ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/holiday-family-feud-comedians-vs-audience
 -tickets-2004458503342?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Winter Wonder Lantern Walks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T183000
UID:2610237NLF0jgXuk-BpgY38ymi8Q
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the beauty and quiet magic of the season during Wint
 er Wonder Lantern Walks\, a festive after-dark experience at Sonoma Botani
 cal Garden. Guided along the route by Garden staff and volunteers\, guests
  will stroll through the winter landscape carrying glowing lanterns\, disc
 overing softly shadowed pathways\, towering trees\, and the peaceful still
 ness of the Garden beneath the night sky. Rather than a traditional docent
 -led tour\, this experience is designed as a peaceful and immersive opport
 unity to enjoy the rare experience of walking through the Garden after hou
 rs and after dark. Along the way\, enjoy moments of reflection\, seasonal 
 ambiance\, and the simple joy of gathering outdoors during the holiday sea
 son.\n\nThe evening begins with hot cocoa\, spiced cider\, wine tasting an
 d cookies from 5:30–6:00 p.m.\, followed by a brief welcome and lantern 
 walk orientation before departing together for a guided walk through the G
 arden.\n\nWinter Wonder Lantern Walks are a seasonal fundraiser that will 
 support the Garden’s programs\, collections\, and conservation efforts. 
 PLEASE READ the important accessibility and experience information\, along
  with the registration and cancellation policy below before purchasing tic
 kets.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/lantern-walks/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
