BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bachata Beginners Thursday
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T193000
UID:2603179T4T7YIxqU6pOgSxzMSAjw
DESCRIPTION:Your First Steps into Bachata\n\nThis class is perfect for bac
 hata beginners that want to learn basic steps and skills\, or those who wa
 nt to refresh their foundational skills. We understand that learning somet
 hing new can feel a little intimidating. That’s why our supportive and r
 elaxed environment is specifically designed to make learning bachata basic
 s an absolute blast!\n\nOur friendly instructors will guide you through:\n
 \n**Basic directional steps:** You’ll learn the fundamental movements t
 hat form the building blocks of all bachata dancing.\n\n**Proper frame for
  partner work:** Discover how to connect comfortably and effectively with
  a partner\, setting you up for smooth and enjoyable dances.\n\n**Simple t
 urn patterns:** We’ll introduce you to easy-to-follow turn patterns tha
 t will have you dancing with a partner in no time.\n\nWe’ve carefully or
 ganized our curriculum to ensure that each movement is easy to grasp and r
 emember\, building your confidence with every step. Our goal is to make le
 arning fun. Join us to learn Bachata in Marin.\n\nImportant Details\n\n**N
 o dance experience required:** Whether you’ve never danced before or it
 ’s been a while\, you’re welcome here!\n\n**No partner necessary:** C
 ome solo or bring a friend—either way\, you’ll have plenty of opportun
 ities to dance.\n\nPlease wear **non-marking shoe soles:** This helps us
  keep our dance floor in great condition.\n\nCome join us and discover the
  joy of bachata! We can’t wait to see you on the dance floor.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/bachata-beginners/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Meet Me in St. Louis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T220000
UID:261112OL2M_SGbQUe8phNa8_t4xg
DESCRIPTION:Meet Me in St. Louis is a heartwarming\, nostalgic musical tha
 t brings the charm and excitement of turn-of-the-century America to life. 
 Set in 1904 on the eve of the St. Louis World’s Fair\, the story follows
  the Smith family through a year of romance\, humor\, and unexpected chang
 e. At its center is the spirited and lovestruck Esther Smith\, whose bloss
 oming romance unfolds alongside her sisters’ own adventures and the fami
 ly’s hopes for the future. Featuring beloved songs like “The Trolley S
 ong\,” “Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\,” and “The Boy Nex
 t Door\,” this classic musical overflows with warmth\, wit\, and unforge
 ttable melodies. Rich with period detail\, lively ensemble numbers\, and t
 ender family moments\, Meet Me in St. Louis celebrates community\, resilie
 nce\, and the enduring power of home. Audiences will be swept up in its co
 lorful seasonal settings—from summer dances to a magical Christmas Eve
 —culminating in the dazzling anticipation of the World’s Fair. Perfect
  for theatregoers of all ages\, this timeless musical offers romance\, lau
 ghter\, and a joyful reminder that even in times of change\, love and fami
 ly light the way forward. MEET ME IN ST. LOUIS is presented by arrangement
  with Concord Theatricals on behalf of Tams-Witmark LLC. concordtheatrical
 s.com
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1599145155293030/1599145195293026/?act
 ive_tab=about
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
