BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Native Plant Garden Volunteer Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T120000
UID:261108_IlpX244NUmJVpZgkEqZSg
DESCRIPTION:Share Your Passion for Pollinators—Join Us in the Garden!\n\
 nJoin the Laguna de Santa Rosa Foundation for a volunteer morning in our 4
 -acre Native Plant Demonstration Garden at the Laguna Environmental Center
 ! Help keep this beautiful garden thriving while connecting with community
  and nature.\n\nVolunteers help with planting\, pruning\, weeding\, and sp
 reading wood chips while caring for a diverse landscape of native wildflow
 ers\, grasses\, trees\, and more. Enjoy special garden features like a liv
 ing willow tunnel\, tranquil pond\, scenic bridge\, and observation deck.\
 n\nNo experience necessary—we provide training\, tools\, and snacks! Wea
 r clothes you don't mind getting dirty. Only heavy rain cancels.
LOCATION:Laguna Environmental Center
URL:https://GardenVolunteerDay1211.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rooted
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T220000
UID:261106vU_LBJlptEavuD9JrQ2V9w
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, Spreckels Theatre Company offers a heart
 warming alternative to traditional seasonal fare with *Rooted*\, a story a
 bout the messy\, fierce love that keeps us grounded. An intelligent\, gent
 le comedy by Deborah Zoe Laufer\, *Rooted* plays Nov. 27 – Dec.13!\n\nEm
 ery is perfectly content living in her beloved treehouse\, completely isol
 ated from the world\, communing with her plants. Meanwhile\, down on the g
 round\, her sister Hazel is thoroughly miserable\, slaving away at a dead-
 end diner job just to survive and financially support Emery’s eccentric 
 lifestyle. Looking on from the sidelines\, Luanne is yearning for somethin
 g\, anything to bring true meaning into her life.\n\n﻿The sisters' fragi
 le ecosystem is completely upended when Emery’s YouTube videos documenti
 ng her plant experiments unexpectedly go viral. Almost overnight\, her dig
 ital musings accidentally incite a full-blown CULT(!). As throngs of devot
 ed truth-seekers congregate below the treehouse\, the lives of all three w
 omen are plunged into chaos\, compelling each woman to choose their own pa
 th and find their bliss.\n\n*Pick-Your-Price Night: purchase sliding scale
  tickets starting at $10 each for the opening Friday night\, Nov. 27th.*
LOCATION:Spreckels Center for the Performing Arts - Bette Condiotti Experi
 mental Theatre
URL:https://spreckelsonline.com/show/2026-27-season/rooted/ 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
