BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HOLY DIVERS – A Tribute to Ronnie James Dio with Head Rush & Wea
 pons
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T233000
UID:260917KEGb1z-nfUartFf-GqBLtQ
DESCRIPTION:Holy Divers – Tribute to Ronnie James Dio with Head Rush & W
 eapons\n\nA night of heavy metal\, classic prog and hard rock in Downtown 
 Santa Rosa!\n\nRaise the horns.  Holy Divers\, a tribute to the legendar
 y Ronnie James Dio\, takes over Barrel Proof Lounge on Friday\, December 1
 1th\, joined by Head Rush and Weapons for a full night of loud guitars and
  heavy music.\n\nHOLY DIVERS – Tribute to Ronnie James Dio\n\nFew voices
  in heavy metal are as unmistakable as Ronnie James Dio. From Rainbow and 
 Black Sabbath to his legendary solo career with Dio\, his music helped def
 ine generations of hard rock and metal.\n\nHoly Divers celebrates that cat
 alog live\, digging into the songs that made Dio an icon. Think soaring vo
 cals\, massive riffs and the music behind classics like Holy Diver\, Rainb
 ow in the Dark\, Heaven and Hell\, The Last in Line and more.\n\nLong live
  rock ’n’ roll. \n\nHEAD RUSH – A Tribute to Rush\n\nHead Rush brin
 gs the music of Rush to the stage\, taking on the intricate musicianship\,
  massive riffs and progressive-rock arrangements of one of rock’s most i
 nfluential power trios.\n\nHead Rush has previously appeared at Barrel Pro
 of alongside other hard-rock tribute acts\, bringing Rush into a night bui
 lt for fans of classic rock\, prog and metal.\n\nFrom the technical precis
 ion to the unmistakable songs\, Rush fans will have plenty to sink their t
 eeth into.\n\nWEAPONS\n\nRounding out the bill is Weapons\, adding another
  dose of heavy music to the night. The band is active on the Northern Cali
 fornia metal circuit\, making them right at home on this triple-bill of ha
 rd rock and heavy metal.\n\nThree bands. One loud Friday night in Downtown
  Santa Rosa.\n\nFRIDAY\, DECEMBER 11\, 2026  Barrel Proof Lounge — 501 
 Mendocino Ave\, Downtown Santa Rosa  Doors: 7 PM  Show: 8 PM  $15 Advan
 ce / $20 Door  21+\n\n Free Popcorn!\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLoung
 e.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://HolyDivers.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
