BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Handbuilding Ceramic Vessels
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T130000
UID:261112tTk6lMQ6cUG8J9Et_P3zWQ
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, students will transform a slab of clay into
  a vase using hand-building techniques. Experiment with sculptural forms\,
  botanical impressions\, carved details\, and organic textures as your ves
 sel takes shape. No two vases will be alike\, each reflecting the maker's 
 own style and creative voice.\n\nAfter firing and glazing\, your finished 
 vase will be waiting to welcome its very first bouquet... a handmade piece
  designed to be filled\, gifted\, and enjoyed for years to come.\n\nAges: 
 Teen-adult (kids can sign up too\, but with an adult)
