 uare dancing\, Bluegrass band\, Line dancing\n\n**Holiday Shopping** – 
 Discover one-of-a-kind gifts\, handcrafted treasures\, and seasonal favori
 tes from local vendors.\n\n**Sip & Savor** – Enjoy delicious seasonal b
 ites\, wine\, and festive refreshments available for purchase.\n\n**Holida
 y Memories** – Gather your loved ones for a cheerful day filled with la
