DESCRIPTION:Sound baths can reduce cortisol \\(the stress hormone\\)\, boo
 st your mood and reduce anxiety\, help with pain management\, enhance slee
 p quality and support mental health and PTSD recovery. 100% of the proceed
 s from this event will be donated to Reach For Home You will take a journe
 y through the use of drums\, flute\, hand pans\, Koshi bells\, crystal sin
 ging bowls\, thumb harp\, Svaram 9-bar chimes and the gong\, to bring you 
 from the beta waves \\(alert and focused\\) to the alpha waves \\(relaxed 
 and creative\\) to the theta wave frequencies \\(deep meditation or dreami
 ng\\) and back again. Come and experience for yourself what the medical jo
 urnals are finally publishing.
